$ nju-connect setup -h
exit: 0
--- stdout
Usage of nju-connect setup:
      --auth-type string        aTrust authentication type (auth/httpsOauth2 or auth/psw)
      --backend string          protocol backend (easyconnect or atrust) (default "easyconnect")
      --login-domain string     aTrust login domain override
      --native-tls-insecure     disable verification only for native protocol TLS
      --password-stdin          read the password from standard input without a terminal prompt
      --server string           campus VPN gateway host or host:port
      --socks-listen string     numeric loopback SOCKS5 listener (default "127.0.0.1:1081")
      --tls-insecure            allow an unverified development gateway certificate
      --upstream-proxy string   optional socks5 upstream URL
      --username string         campus account
--- stderr
